    "灵敏度" : {},
    "点「输入密码」再解压" : {},
    "点一行编辑，右边的开关暂停或打开那一条。一次性的提醒点了「知道了」就从列表里拿掉。" : {},
    "点一行编辑，右边的开关暂停或打开那一条。一次性的提醒点了「知道了」就从列表里拿掉。最多 %lld 条，已经满了，删掉一条才能再加。" : {},
    "点刘海、两指往下滑或者按「打开刘海岛」的快捷键（到 设置 › 快捷键 里设）叫出来的就是这一排。刘海两边挂着东西（在放歌、在录制）时，点刘海先展开它，再往下滑一次才是这一排。拖动调整先后。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This row comes up when you click the notch, swipe down with two fingers, or press the Open Notch shortcut (set it in Settings › Shortcuts). When something hangs beside the notch (music playing, a recording), clicking the notch expands that first; swipe down once more for this row. Drag to reorder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点刘海叫出快捷动作，录屏计时、提醒倒数、正在播放挂在刘海两边、点开是卡片" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Click the notch for quick actions. Recording timers, reminder countdowns, and Now Playing sit beside the notch and open into cards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点刘海或在刘海上两指往下滑：打开——刘海两边挂着东西时是它的卡片，再往下滑一次轮到下一个，最后是快捷动作" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Click the notch or swipe down on it with two fingers to open: the card for whatever hangs beside the notch, then the next one each time you swipe down, and finally the quick actions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点刘海打开" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Click the notch to open"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点刘海打开时显示月历" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Show a month calendar when you open the notch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点开头的、整块盘、系统文件夹不动，或者没有权限" : {},
    "点录制框后按下新组合，或者快速连按两下 ⌘ ⌥ ⌃ ⇧ 中的一个；Esc 取消，⌫ 清除，右键可恢复默认。连按两下要「辅助功能」授权。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Click a shortcut field and press a new combination, or quickly press one of ⌘ ⌥ ⌃ ⇧ twice; Esc cancels, ⌫ clears, and right-click restores the default. Pressing twice needs Accessibility permission."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点菜单栏图标，选「更新到 %@」" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Click the menu bar icon and choose “Update to %@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "焦点在列表或便签墙上时：删除选中的便签，进「最近删除」（⌫ 也行；在最近删除里是永久删除，要确认）。光标在标题、正文里时是删到行首" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With the list or Note Wall focused: move the selected note to Recently Deleted (⌫ works too; in Recently Deleted it deletes permanently after confirming). In the title or text, deletes to the start of the line"
          }
        }
      }
