    "用备份：便签回到 %@备份时的样子，那之后写的、改的不在里面。出问题的便签数据留在「damaged-日期-时间」文件夹里。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use Backup: notes go back to how they were in the %@ backup; anything written or changed after that isn’t included. The damaged notes data stays in the “damaged-date-time” folder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用备份：片段、收藏、收藏夹、生词本和启动器的收藏回到 %@备份时的样子；普通剪贴板历史、翻译历史和启动器的使用记录不在备份里，会从空的开始。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use Backup: snippets, favorites, collections, the Word List, and launcher favorites go back to how they were in the %@ backup. Clipboard history, translation history, and launcher usage aren’t in the backup and start empty."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用备份：片段、收藏、收藏夹、生词本和启动器的收藏回到 %@备份时的样子；普通剪贴板历史、翻译历史和启动器的使用记录不在备份里，会从空的开始。出问题的数据库和当时的图片都留在「damaged-日期-时间」文件夹里（全部数据还在里面）。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use Backup: snippets, favorites, collections, the Word List, and launcher favorites go back to how they were in the %@ backup. Clipboard history, translation history, and launcher usage aren’t in the backup and start empty. The damaged database and the images from that time stay in the “damaged-date-time” folder (all the data is still in it)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
