    "看着指针有没有停在刘海上；打开了系统提示才听电源、耳机、网络，打开了正在播放才起一个读播放信息的小进程，打开了下一个日程才读日历，打开了音量和亮度才接那五个键。不添加时提示照常弹" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watches for the pointer resting on the notch. Listens for power, headphones, and network only with System Notices on, runs a small helper for playback info only with Now Playing on, reads your calendar only with Next Event on, and takes over the five volume and brightness keys only with Volume and Brightness on. Without the plugin, notices still appear."
          }
        }
      }
