    "读系统「日历」里的日程，打开「下一个日程」时会问一次授权。全天的、已拒绝的不算下一个日程；日程的内容只留在这台 Mac 上，不进最近的提示。月历本身不用授权。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reads events from the system Calendar and asks for permission once when you turn on the next event. All-day and declined events don't count as the next event; event details stay on this Mac and stay out of recent notices. The month calendar needs no permission."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "读系统的「正在播放」要另起一个小进程（约 4 MB，没在放时不耗电），关掉就退出。暂停 30 秒后刘海两边收起；想接着放，点刘海再两指往下滑一次还找得到它。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reading the system's Now Playing takes a small separate process (about 4 MB, no power used when nothing is playing) that quits when this is off. After 30 seconds paused it leaves the notch; to resume, click the notch and swipe down with two fingers once more to find it."
          }
        }
      }
